& [PrimaryFindings] are exact
  + [NORMAL] value 0x80 is valid only when used alone
  + [DIRECTORY] value is 0x10
  + [REPARSE_POINT] value is 0x400 and identifies an associated reparse point or symbolic link
  + [OFFLINE] and recall attributes describe content not immediately or fully present locally
  + [reserved_characters] and controls match the selected strict component exclusions
  + [reserved_devices] include fixed, numbered 1 through 9, and superscript 1 through 3 COM and LPT stems even with extensions
  + [terminal_space_or_period] is discouraged by the Windows namespace contract
  + [case] must not be assumed sensitive

& [Delineation] is necessary
  + [pure_truth] a supplied u32 and component either satisfy this closed profile or do not
  + [physical_truth] whether an API supplied complete accurate metadata remains a later seam and fixture obligation
  + [Git_truth] mode and inventory reconciliation remain separate
  + [Unicode_truth] no semantic normalization or confusable policy is claimed

& [Decision] is bounded
  + [implement_now] exact pure constants, validators, decision record, closed fault enum, and exhaustive tests
  + [defer] Win32 query, UTF-16 decoding, component enumeration, traversal, Git reconciliation, stream parsing, and target-host fixtures
  + [reason] pure policy reduces the future unsafe seam without converting unobserved host behavior into a claim
